{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/039",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u09132",
   "en": "Eager is not the same as ready, Shepard. There is too much at stake. We need to put aside our personal feelings and focus on stopping Saren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09133",
   "en": "I wish it did not have to be that way, but we all have to make sacrifices. Let's... let's talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09134",
   "en": "Then let us talk about you. Are you okay?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09135",
   "en": "I wish there was something I could do to help you. You need to be at your best, Commander. The crew relies on you for leadership. It can be a heavy burden.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09136",
   "en": "You need to take care of yourself, Commander. The crew relies on you for leadership. It can be a heavy burden.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09137",
   "en": "You do not have to put on a brave face for me, Commander. This crew relies on you for leadership. It can be a heavy burden.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09138",
   "en": "I have no doubt about that. But can they carry the weight of an entire galaxy? If we don't stop Saren-- no. Never mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09139",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Commander. The last thing you need is someone constantly reminding you of how grim things are. Is there anything else you would rather talk about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09140",
   "en": "Of course, Commander. Just forget I even brought it up. Let's talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09141",
   "en": "Benezia was swept up in events beyond her control and lost herself. She fell under the spell of indoctrination and became part of the very thing she wanted to stop.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09142",
   "en": "I showed them the truth and they still won't believe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09143",
   "en": "Udina couldn't wait to stab me in the back!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09144",
   "en": "I don't care if they ground me, but they refuse to go after Saren. If they don't stop him from finding the Conduit, we're all dead!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09145",
   "en": "I should've known better. Udina, the Council -- they're all the same. Petty, blind, and stupid!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09146",
   "en": "While they sit on their asses, Saren's searching Ilos for the Conduit. As soon as he finds it, we're all dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09147",
   "en": "I pushed them as hard as I could! They wouldn't budge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09148",
   "en": "We're out of the game for now. But I'll find a way back in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09149",
   "en": "I'll think of something. I just need some time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09150",
   "en": "I don't need you yapping in my ear while I'm trying to figure out a way to fix this!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09151",
   "en": "I didn't mean to snap at you. I appreciate everything you've done. I do. I just... I just don't know what to do next!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09152",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Liara. I just don't know what to do next!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09153",
   "en": "You want to help? Figure out a way to get the Normandy in the air again!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09154",
   "en": "You're right. There is something between us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09155",
   "en": "Sorry, Liara. I'm not interested in you. Not in that way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09156",
   "en": "No, you were right. There is something between us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09157",
   "en": "These things never make sense. They just happen, and we get swept up in the storm.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09158",
   "en": "Quit thinking like a scientist. Logic doesn't work when it comes to relationships. Just let yourself get swept up in the storm.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09159",
   "en": "Saren wants both of us dead. That's something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09160",
   "en": "I'll keep you safe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09161",
   "en": "Don't tell me a little danger puts you off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09162",
   "en": "A little danger makes things exciting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09163",
   "en": "Take all the time you need, Liara. I'll be here. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09164",
   "en": "I wasn't the one who brought this up!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09165",
   "en": "I'm not interested in you in that way, Liara.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09166",
   "en": "It's not a big deal. Don't worry about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09167",
   "en": "You make it sound almost mystical.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09168",
   "en": "It sounds amazing. Are you saying--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09169",
   "en": "That's a little strange for me. I don't know if I'm ready to--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09170",
   "en": "Are you saying you want to--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09171",
   "en": "I want you to be absolutely sure about this, Liara. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09172",
   "en": "Wait... are you saying this is your first time?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09173",
   "en": "Are you telling me you're a virgin?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09174",
   "en": "These are dark times, Liara. Maybe once all this is over...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09175",
   "en": "I'm ready... if you are.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09176",
   "en": "I'm not sleeping well. The visions keep me up at night.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09177",
   "en": "Don't worry about me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09178",
   "en": "I can handle the responsibility of command. But if I don't stop Saren, the entire galaxy gets wiped out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09179",
   "en": "I've got broad shoulders.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09180",
   "en": "There's nothing wrong with me!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09181",
   "en": "It wasn't you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09182",
   "en": "They're idiots!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09183",
   "en": "They screwed me!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09184",
   "en": "There are bigger issues.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09185",
   "en": "You can't trust politicians.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09186",
   "en": "And doom the galaxy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09187",
   "en": "I tried!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09188",
   "en": "What's the use?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09189",
   "en": "Not now, Liara!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09190",
   "en": "Stay strong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09191",
   "en": "Not a chance!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09192",
   "en": "Give me some time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09193",
   "en": "No, I'm sorry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09194",
   "en": "Well, you didn't!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09195",
   "en": "There is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09196",
   "en": "You were wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09197",
   "en": "I am attracted to you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09198",
   "en": "I just want to be friends.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09199",
   "en": "You were way off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09200",
   "en": "It doesn't have to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09201",
   "en": "Don't analyze this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09202",
   "en": "We have one thing in common.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09203",
   "en": "I'll protect you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09204",
   "en": "Are you scared?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09205",
   "en": "That's why it's fun.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09206",
   "en": "It's a lot to handle.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09207",
   "en": "You started it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09208",
   "en": "A spiritual exchange?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09209",
   "en": "Is this a proposition?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09210",
   "en": "I'm intrigued.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09211",
   "en": "Sounds weird.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09212",
   "en": "You've never done this?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09213",
   "en": "Unbelievable!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09214",
   "en": "I have nightmares.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09215",
   "en": "They're not the problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09216",
   "en": "I can handle it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09217",
   "en": "This is a waste of time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09218",
   "en": "Shepard? May I speak with you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09219",
   "en": "I have been thinking about you, too. And what we are about to face.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09220",
   "en": "There is never a good time. But I need to say this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09221",
   "en": "I do not know what is going to happen on Ilos. I hope we will stop Saren, of course, but part of me fears we are already too late.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09222",
   "en": "There is something I must tell you, in case we fail.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09223",
   "en": "Please... I am not looking for comfort. Saren might already have the Conduit. It is time to be completely honest with each other.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09224",
   "en": "These could be our last moments together. Our last chance to show each other how we feel. I want this to be special.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09225",
   "en": "I would've come to you sooner, but I was afraid. A union with another species can be a life-altering event. I do not usually... I... have never done this before, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09226",
   "en": "\"Virgin\" does not have the same connotation in my culture as in yours. But it is true I have never done this before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09227",
   "en": "I never really thought about it. Not until I met you. I want to do this, Shepard... and this may be our last chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09228",
   "en": "I have never been more sure of anything in my life. Will you join with me, Shepard? Let our bodies and minds unite.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09229",
   "en": "I thought my people were supposed to be the cautious ones, Shepard. I want this to happen... and we may not have another chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09230",
   "en": "By the Goddess! That was incredible, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09231",
   "en": "Commander! ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09232",
   "en": "Five minutes ETA to the Mu Relay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09233",
   "en": "I had better go. Duty calls. You would not want to keep Joker waiting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09234",
   "en": "Shepard? Whatever happens on Ilos, I just wanted to say... thank you. For everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09235",
   "en": "I see. You are right, of course. I apologize, Commander. I will leave you alone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09236",
   "en": "Commander, five minutes ETA to the Mu Relay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09237",
   "en": "Besides, you will figure something out. You always do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09238",
   "en": "Some unions are a single encounter between two willing individuals. But there are cases where an asari and her partner choose to remain together.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09239",
   "en": "When that happens, we do not focus on the inevitable loss. Instead, we enjoy the time we are given.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09240",
   "en": "And even after a partner has passed on, a part of them lives on in us. The union is a connection that transcends both time and space.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09241",
   "en": "We were the first species to discover the Citadel. We were instrumental in forming the Council. And we always strive to be the voice of peaceful cooperation in galactic disputes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09242",
   "en": "My people believe we are all part of a single galactic community. Each species contributes something to the greater whole.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09243",
   "en": "Although we seek to understand other species, it seems few of them seek to understand us. The galaxy is filled with rumors and misinformation about my people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09244",
   "en": "Most of the inaccuracies are centered around our mating rituals. My species is mono-gendered. \"Male\" and \"female\" have no real meaning for us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09245",
   "en": "We still require a partner to reproduce. This second parent, however, may be of any species and any gender.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09246",
   "en": "Mating is not quite the proper term. Not as you understand it. Physical contact may or may not be involved, but it is not an essential element of the union.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09247",
   "en": "Now you see how rumors get started. Physical contact may or may not be involved, but it is not an essential element of the union.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09248",
   "en": "The true connection is mental. Our physiology allow us to meld with other beings. We can touch the very depths of their minds.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09249",
   "en": "We explore the genetic memory of their species. We share the most basic elements of their individual and racial identities.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09250",
   "en": "We then pass these traits on to our daughters. It is how we learn to grow as a species, and how we develop a greater understanding of other races.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09251",
   "en": "Every relationship is different. Some unions are a single encounter, with both parents parting ways afterwards.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09252",
   "en": "Others can be more long-term. Sometimes an asari and her partner will stay together for many decades.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09253",
   "en": "Few sapient species live as long as my kind. We have learned to take a philosophical approach to our unions.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09254",
   "en": "We do not focus on the inevitable loss of our partners. Instead, we enjoy the time we spend with them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09255",
   "en": "And even after they are gone, a part of them lives on in us. The union is a connection that transcends both time and space.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09256",
   "en": "But I will remember and honor how she lived, not how she died. My mother was strong, kind, and beautiful. And now she is gone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09257",
   "en": "You are kind to ask, Shepard. I do miss her. And I grieve for what happened to her. But I will not let my grief interfere with what we are trying to accomplish.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09258",
   "en": "Maybe she thought allying herself with Saren would somehow be for the greater good in the long run. At least, I hope so.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09259",
   "en": "None of this makes any sense to me. I have not spoken to Benezia in many years, but I know her! And this was not like her. Something changed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09260",
   "en": "No, not the Benezia I knew. But I hadn't spoken with my mother in many years. She may have changed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09261",
   "en": "I was just thinking about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09262",
   "en": "It's not really a good time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09263",
   "en": "I always have time for you, Liara.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09264",
   "en": "We're not going to fail. I promise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09265",
   "en": "I don't plan on failing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09266",
   "en": "Go ahead. I'm listening.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09267",
   "en": "I want you to be sure about this, Liara. Especially if this is your first time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09268",
   "en": "Wait... are you saying this would be your first time?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09269",
   "en": "We don't have to do this. Not unless you're sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09270",
   "en": "I want this, Liara. I do. But are you sure you're ready?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
